\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ueqR02mtOXAQ7kNvwEKS3of&_nc_oc=AdnbhnzQQyztmhwsS9DiAwfmNz3WP8reiPdi7yyQEG5XKdjV_P__LfTO0c_sDShiY6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxZUeDc3Vj04G6odYFB-e9MflY3PzDSKMkN_4ifqXaiqQ&oe=69B7E7F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R3_MHlOCz30Q7kNvwGB_wTE&_nc_oc=AdnohiEz5hoAy2DEWlg1YVETN8Bteudg9GZQd8aE_BmXK3DYclNHOmnQ-fU-vdyx4Oc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxzziyQOQKr7Dg_zNqoZPlDXYZqUQS4451aagAlcyMPug&oe=69B7E956"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RpuHjxVTmfoQ7kNvwEYqHUj&_nc_oc=Admf87U8LnaI70k6kBNmjQu3pMHNUWQXv-1rwkRsXP5JQORkolp7yCArrTIGA74DyTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzQRIwRbMsV7w5g1YS6LH-slV981ogx36faCUf4FaT3LQ&oe=69B7FE77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771